e account, and you also run Orlavine's medical account, so I can't confirm it's the Group. Please check before you include it.\n\n**Left out**\n- #4812 (EV charger bay conflicts, Mar 2025): Vantorre Mobility.\n- #PD-4402 (Quillfeather Outfitters): different account.\n- The Moss digests on 10 Mar 2025, 7 Jul 2025, 1 Dec 2025, 3 May 2026 and 3 Aug 2026 mention Group issues but give no ticket number.\n\nSources are the channel posts and Moss digest files named above. Nothing here came from a direct message."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1792159200.000126"}}
